# Keep the build context (and therefore the image) free of anything that
# .gitignore keeps out of git but COPY . /app would otherwise still bake
# into the image layer -- including secrets, if a local .env happens to be
# sitting in the tree at build time.
.git/
.github/

docs/submission_evidence.md
submission_evidence.md
POTENTIAL-FINDINGS.md
docs/POTENTIAL-FINDINGS.md

results/
web/screenshots/
*.db
*.sqlite
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
racemap_report.json
racemap_ollama.json

.env
*.key

web/demo_record.py

# Local-only, not needed inside the image
session-notes/
*.md
!README.md
